#: ui/static/projects/ui/js/settings.js
msgid "Convert to scrum"
msgstr "Convertir en scrum"

#: ui/static/projects/ui/js/settings.js
msgid ""
"Every task on a board column joins a new running sprint. Backlog tasks stay "
"unplanned, and the board shows one sprint at a time."
msgstr ""
"Chaque tâche d’une colonne du tableau rejoint un nouveau sprint en cours. "
"Les tâches du backlog restent hors sprint, et le tableau affiche un sprint à "
"la fois."

#: ui/static/projects/ui/js/settings.js
msgid "Convert to kanban"
msgstr "Convertir en kanban"

#: ui/static/projects/ui/js/settings.js
msgid ""
"The running sprint is closed and planned sprints are deleted, returning "
"their tasks to the backlog pool. Tasks keep their columns and closed sprints "
"stay as history."
msgstr ""
"Le sprint en cours est clôturé et les sprints planifiés sont supprimés, "
"leurs tâches retournant dans le backlog. Les tâches gardent leur colonne et "
"les sprints clôturés restent dans l’historique."

